y time effectively between studies and personal life.','2026-04-17','Pending','Time management is key. Create a daily timetable, prioritize tasks, and avoid distractions. Ensure you balance study time with rest. I can help you design a proper schedule.','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(11,'22711A0535','I am facing pressure from family regarding my academic results.','2026-04-17','Completed',NULL,'No',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(12,'22711A0535','I feel low confidence while presenting in class.','2026-04-17','Completed','Confidence builds with practice. Start by preparing well, practicing in front of a mirror, and speaking in small groups. Gradually, you will feel more comfortable. I can also share techniques to improve your presentation skills.','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(13,'22711A0535','I am having trouble adjusting to the college environment.','2026-04-17','Pending','Adjusting to a new environment takes time. Try engaging in activities, making new friends, and participating in events. It will help you feel more comfortable and connected.','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(14,'22711A0535','I am experiencing frequent distractions while studying.','2026-04-17','Completed','Try creating a dedicated study space and limiting distractions like mobile phones. Use techniques like the Pomodoro method to improve focus. Setting clear goals can also help you stay on track.','No',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(15,'22711A0501','academic pressure','2026-04-17','Pending',NULL,'No',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(16,'22711A0535','need guidance for selecting a good final year project.','2026-04-17','Resolved by HOD','d','Yes','need','sujitha@gmail.com','2026-04-30 14:36:09','d','penchalaiah@gmail.com'),(17,'23711A0505','I am finding it difficult to understand machine learning algorithms like regression and classification.','2026-04-17','Completed','Start with simple concepts using visual explanations, follow beginner-friendly courses, and implement small examples step by step.','No',NULL,NU